 For developers This package has  arviz_example_data  as a data dependency, which is included as an  artifact . When  arviz_example_data  is updated, and a new release is made,  Artifacts.toml  should be updated to point to the new tarball corresponding to the release: julia> using ArtifactUtils

julia> version = v"0.1.0";

julia> tarball_url = "https://github.com/arviz-devs/arviz_example_data/archive/refs/tags/v$version.tar.gz";

julia> add_artifact!("Artifacts.toml", "arviz_example_data", tarball_url; force=true);
